fablepowers
===========

Third-party attribution
-----------------------

Three skills shipped by this plugin are derived from superpowers
(https://github.com/obra/superpowers) v7.0.0 by Jesse Vincent, used under the
MIT license:

  skills/systematic-debugging/
  skills/using-git-worktrees/
  skills/finishing-a-development-branch/

along with the test for the vendored bisection script:

  tests/systematic-debugging/test-find-polluter.sh

They are vendored substantially as published, with cross-references retargeted
to the skills this plugin ships and unreferenced skill-authoring artifacts
removed. using-git-worktrees and finishing-a-development-branch are also
adapted (consent from a plan's worktree request; worktree location and cleanup
anchored at the project root; PR creation via gh, fj or glab). Each SKILL.md
carries an attribution line under its frontmatter saying what was adapted.

The rest of this repository — every other skill, the agents, the hook, the
scripts and the docs — is original work licensed under this repository's
LICENSE. The workflow it encodes is a fork of the ideas in superpowers, but the
text is not copied from it except where a skill says so in an attribution
sentence.

